# Ops runbooks (local-only; survive git clean -fd without -x).
# Ignore contents of docs/ops/ but NOT the directory itself so the
# un-ignore of the shared runbook works (git cannot re-include a file
# under a fully-ignored parent directory).
docs/ops/*
!docs/ops/
!docs/ops/backup-restore.md

# Local SQLite backup output (F065)
backups/
